WEBVTT

00:00:03.730 --> 00:00:05.310
Flying in the sky

00:00:05.310 --> 00:00:07.440
<i>takaku habatake</i>
Soar high up

00:00:07.770 --> 00:00:10.190
<i>oozora o dokomade mo</i>
Anywhere across the sky

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:12.030
Shining Finger

00:00:12.110 --> 00:00:13.900
<i>kagayaku hikari ga</i>
The shining light

00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:17.280
<i>chi no hate terashi kiseki o yobu spell</i>
A spell that spreads
miracles throughout the world

00:00:17.620 --> 00:00:20.740
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:00:20.740 --> 00:00:26.420
<i>furimukazu aruku no sa</i>
Walk forward and never turn back

00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:32.670
<i>mugen no chikara ga aru</i>
I have an unlimited power

00:00:34.630 --> 00:00:40.100
<i>nando demo tamesu no sa</i>
I must test myself many times

00:00:41.560 --> 00:00:48.440
<i>donna ni kurushikutemo yaritogeru</i>
Do it all no matter how painful

00:00:48.440 --> 00:00:51.730
<i>ai wa itsumo kono mune ni</i>
Love is always in my heart

00:00:51.820 --> 00:00:55.240
<i>towa ni kieru koto wa nai</i>
It will never fade

00:00:55.240 --> 00:00:58.320
<i>kono te ga sakendeiru</i>
My hand cries out loud

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:02.330
<i>ashita e to hashire</i>
To run toward tomorrow

00:01:02.410 --> 00:01:04.080
Bright you now

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:08.580
<i>kimi ga egaita mirai e no shinario wa</i>
The future that you envision

00:01:09.420 --> 00:01:10.920
Shining Finger

00:01:10.920 --> 00:01:12.590
<i>yume o tsukamou</i>
Take hold of our dreams

00:01:12.590 --> 00:01:16.130
<i>subete wa omou mama ni I get a chance</i>
Everything will go
my way if I get a chance

00:01:23.260 --> 00:01:24.810
Now then, everyone.

00:01:24.810 --> 00:01:27.250
Many surprising
events have been occurring.

00:01:28.100 --> 00:01:31.980
In the previous episode, Domon,
answering a mysterious SOS...

00:01:32.440 --> 00:01:36.070
...was attacked by his four rivals,
who had acquired ferocious powers.

00:01:39.450 --> 00:01:41.660
And then appeared
a terrifying Gundam.

00:01:43.280 --> 00:01:45.950
As these deepening
mysteries continue...

00:01:45.950 --> 00:01:47.750
...there is another new incident.

00:01:48.540 --> 00:01:50.120
From space...

00:01:50.120 --> 00:01:53.540
...four unidentified lights are
seen headed toward Earth.

00:01:56.510 --> 00:01:59.760
These lights are headed
toward Shinjuku.

00:01:59.970 --> 00:02:00.930
Yes.

00:02:00.930 --> 00:02:04.290
Shinjuku, where mysteries are
attracting even more mysteries.

00:02:07.350 --> 00:02:08.850
And now!

00:02:08.850 --> 00:02:13.400
Gundam Fight!
Ready! Go!

00:02:13.400 --> 00:02:19.450
Shocking!
Shining Finger Defeated!

00:02:50.670 --> 00:02:52.810
What's the information
from the satellite?

00:02:53.690 --> 00:02:55.650
It appears they were first
observed about two hours ago.

00:02:56.320 --> 00:02:58.190
Four unidentified objects...

00:02:58.190 --> 00:03:00.360
...are about to land
here in Shinjuku.

00:03:01.200 --> 00:03:04.490
Do you have any information
from the Colony?

00:03:04.490 --> 00:03:05.950
No, nothing.

00:03:05.950 --> 00:03:06.830
Of course not!

00:03:07.700 --> 00:03:10.500
Those guys up there don't care
what happens to us on Earth.

00:03:10.910 --> 00:03:12.370
Besides...

00:03:12.370 --> 00:03:15.290
...ever think that the guys
in the Colony...

00:03:15.290 --> 00:03:17.670
...might be the ones
causing all this?

00:03:17.670 --> 00:03:18.550
Hey.

00:03:18.550 --> 00:03:20.260
That's no way to talk about them.

00:03:20.260 --> 00:03:22.280
They're the ones helping us.

00:03:26.420 --> 00:03:27.470
Master Asia?

00:03:31.680 --> 00:03:32.620
Master?

00:03:38.440 --> 00:03:40.610
I'm positive that was Master.

00:03:42.150 --> 00:03:44.240
It looks like he's headed
toward Shinjuku Station.

00:03:48.280 --> 00:03:51.370
I'm not as strong as
Master or Domon...

00:03:51.370 --> 00:03:52.480
...so I have no choice, right?

00:04:03.230 --> 00:04:05.070
I wonder where he went.

00:04:08.090 --> 00:04:09.350
Master?

00:04:13.060 --> 00:04:14.140
Master?

00:04:15.480 --> 00:04:17.400
Master, where are you?

00:04:18.470 --> 00:04:19.900
Master?

00:04:27.800 --> 00:04:28.770
Master?

00:04:35.790 --> 00:04:36.770
What the...?!

00:04:37.840 --> 00:04:39.760
Oh, no. It won't open.

00:04:47.820 --> 00:04:49.110
Someone's calling...

00:05:02.040 --> 00:05:03.110
Domon.

00:05:04.820 --> 00:05:06.070
Did you sleep well?

00:05:06.620 --> 00:05:09.010
No. I can't say that I have lately.

00:05:09.860 --> 00:05:12.990
Maybe it's because I'm still
concerned about those guys.

00:05:13.320 --> 00:05:14.980
Well, that's to be expected.

00:05:15.540 --> 00:05:17.780
I'm still having problems
believing it.

00:05:18.520 --> 00:05:20.460
Even just the fact that
they were here.

00:05:21.190 --> 00:05:22.210
How about you, Master?

00:05:22.610 --> 00:05:23.460
You able to sleep?

00:05:23.860 --> 00:05:24.840
Me?

00:05:25.670 --> 00:05:29.220
I always maintain peace of mind,
no matter what turmoil I face.

00:05:30.250 --> 00:05:31.680
I slept all night.

00:05:32.390 --> 00:05:33.600
You're so amazing, Master.

00:05:34.380 --> 00:05:36.450
By the way, your partner...

00:05:37.000 --> 00:05:38.100
What's her name?

00:05:38.100 --> 00:05:39.020
You mean Rain?

00:05:39.020 --> 00:05:40.060
That's right.

00:05:40.060 --> 00:05:41.320
Where is she this morning?

00:05:41.860 --> 00:05:43.610
Weren't you meeting her
for breakfast?

00:05:43.900 --> 00:05:45.900
I bet she's still asleep.

00:05:45.900 --> 00:05:47.770
She does have low blood pressure.

00:05:49.610 --> 00:05:51.600
That's no way to talk
about women, Domon.

00:06:10.430 --> 00:06:11.590
This way...

00:06:19.730 --> 00:06:21.400
Unidentified objects?

00:06:21.400 --> 00:06:22.560
That's right.

00:06:22.560 --> 00:06:24.480
Four large unknown objects...

00:06:24.480 --> 00:06:26.480
...and they're headed right here!

00:06:26.480 --> 00:06:28.190
You think they're
enemy reinforcements?!

00:06:28.740 --> 00:06:30.780
Four unidentified objects?

00:06:33.780 --> 00:06:34.950
Could they be...?!

00:06:34.950 --> 00:06:35.850
Master?

00:06:37.790 --> 00:06:39.620
Does that mean anything to you?

00:06:39.620 --> 00:06:40.290
What?!

00:06:42.630 --> 00:06:43.790
Emergency!

00:06:43.960 --> 00:06:45.800
Death Army in the East Side!

00:06:46.000 --> 00:06:48.210
Emergency!
Death Army in the East Side!

00:06:48.210 --> 00:06:51.220
They keep coming,
no matter how many we destroy!

00:06:51.220 --> 00:06:52.220
Let's go, Domon!

00:06:52.220 --> 00:06:52.840
Sir!

00:06:53.590 --> 00:06:56.510
Shining Gundam!

00:07:15.490 --> 00:07:18.540
I'll get rid of all of you
once and for all!

00:08:02.160 --> 00:08:04.120
- Domon! Come over here!
- Yes, sir!

00:08:07.710 --> 00:08:08.460
Domon.

00:08:08.460 --> 00:08:11.130
It's a waste of our time
fighting the foot soldiers.

00:08:11.670 --> 00:08:12.590
Listen.

00:08:12.590 --> 00:08:14.840
Hit the general and the army
will naturally collapse!

00:08:15.590 --> 00:08:17.350
That's a basic rule of strategy!

00:08:17.850 --> 00:08:19.350
But where's the general?

00:08:19.350 --> 00:08:21.810
Look! Over there! That one!

00:08:26.540 --> 00:08:27.270
That's...!

00:08:28.400 --> 00:08:29.870
Gundam Rose!

00:08:33.950 --> 00:08:35.070
George...

00:08:35.070 --> 00:08:38.620
Have you really become a
follower of the Devil Gundam?

00:08:38.620 --> 00:08:39.660
What're you waiting for?

00:08:40.280 --> 00:08:43.410
Just leave these guys to me
and go destroy him.

00:08:43.410 --> 00:08:44.370
Right, Master!

00:08:52.170 --> 00:08:53.760
Snap out of it, George!

00:08:53.760 --> 00:08:55.470
What about the Gundam Fight?!

00:08:55.470 --> 00:08:58.470
I don't care what you have to say!

00:09:04.180 --> 00:09:05.320
Get this straight.

00:09:06.140 --> 00:09:09.860
The Gundam Fight means
nothing to me any more.

00:09:10.610 --> 00:09:11.360
Yes.

00:09:11.360 --> 00:09:12.980
Now that I have met the one.

00:09:13.320 --> 00:09:14.940
The one?

00:09:14.940 --> 00:09:16.820
You mean my evil brother?

00:09:17.200 --> 00:09:18.800
I won't forgive that.

00:09:19.450 --> 00:09:23.790
I know he's your brother, but you
cannot talk rudely about him!

00:09:24.200 --> 00:09:25.370
He's not my brother.

00:09:25.370 --> 00:09:27.420
He's a monster!

00:09:29.710 --> 00:09:31.460
Rose Bits!

00:09:31.880 --> 00:09:33.380
Not those again!

00:09:35.420 --> 00:09:36.950
You keep using the same trick!

00:09:45.560 --> 00:09:47.880
Not bad at all,
Domon Kasshu.

00:09:48.650 --> 00:09:50.370
But do you think you can
handle this?

00:09:53.780 --> 00:09:54.400
An earthquake?

00:09:58.490 --> 00:09:59.990
What is this?

00:10:02.660 --> 00:10:04.330
Gundam Maxter?

00:10:07.040 --> 00:10:08.500
Dragon Gundam!

00:10:11.960 --> 00:10:13.190
Bolt Gundam!

00:10:26.640 --> 00:10:29.890
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:10:42.740 --> 00:10:44.650
Wh-where am I?

00:10:45.830 --> 00:10:47.310
But how did I get here?

00:10:54.130 --> 00:10:55.340
I remember this...

00:11:02.840 --> 00:11:05.560
These are all DG cell
cultivation capsules?!

00:11:11.850 --> 00:11:12.520
They're...!

00:11:24.620 --> 00:11:26.990
Have we been saved?

00:11:28.040 --> 00:11:29.330
You'll be okay.

00:11:29.330 --> 00:11:31.660
You hadn't been exposed
to the DG cells yet.

00:11:32.250 --> 00:11:33.830
We owe Neo Japan for this.

00:11:34.630 --> 00:11:36.790
But what are you people
doing in Shinjuku?

00:11:37.380 --> 00:11:38.140
Behind you!

00:11:47.140 --> 00:11:48.390
We're surrounded.

00:11:50.600 --> 00:11:52.930
I guess we'd better
get out of here.

00:11:53.310 --> 00:11:55.230
We have to force our way through.

00:11:55.230 --> 00:11:56.150
And leave this place!

00:12:11.950 --> 00:12:12.870
What do you think...

00:12:13.250 --> 00:12:15.880
...of this incredible power
we've obtained?

00:12:16.540 --> 00:12:18.090
I'm very disappointed, George.

00:12:18.670 --> 00:12:20.840
You're fighting four against one.

00:12:21.210 --> 00:12:24.050
What happened to that
proud chivalry of yours?!

00:12:24.880 --> 00:12:27.760
I have no regrets leaving
behind such trifles.

00:12:28.140 --> 00:12:29.680
What about Sai Saici?!

00:12:29.680 --> 00:12:32.180
What about restoring
the Shaolin Temple?!

00:12:32.480 --> 00:12:35.650
Argo! Do you plan to
abandon your pirate friends?!

00:12:35.650 --> 00:12:36.940
Chibodee!

00:12:36.940 --> 00:12:39.650
Was your dream to become
a slave of the Devil Gundam?!

00:12:40.480 --> 00:12:43.470
You can be so petty,
Domon Kasshu.

00:12:44.530 --> 00:12:46.490
No matter how we try to explain...

00:12:46.490 --> 00:12:49.870
...you won't ever understand
the greatness of the one.

00:12:50.280 --> 00:12:51.620
Of course not!

00:12:51.620 --> 00:12:53.410
Why would I follow his orders?!

00:12:53.410 --> 00:12:56.080
And so you shall be destroyed!

00:12:56.870 --> 00:12:58.040
Wait!

00:13:06.880 --> 00:13:07.680
Master!

00:13:09.800 --> 00:13:11.560
Then he's behind all this?

00:13:11.560 --> 00:13:14.600
That's right!
This is all a trap that he set!

00:13:15.020 --> 00:13:16.100
But how could that be?

00:13:16.270 --> 00:13:17.100
Yes!

00:13:17.190 --> 00:13:20.440
We were all tricked into coming
here like you were.

00:13:20.610 --> 00:13:23.360
He challenged us to
Gundam Fights...

00:13:23.360 --> 00:13:24.800
...which is why we're here.

00:13:25.320 --> 00:13:28.160
We were drawn by
this strange light.

00:13:28.160 --> 00:13:29.530
The next thing we knew...

00:13:29.530 --> 00:13:31.660
...we were trapped in those capsules!

00:13:31.990 --> 00:13:32.910
And then we saw them!

00:13:33.450 --> 00:13:35.410
Like they were being possessed...

00:13:35.410 --> 00:13:37.920
...we saw them all start
to become evil.

00:13:38.210 --> 00:13:40.500
They'd forgotten about
the Gundam Fight...

00:13:40.500 --> 00:13:43.550
...and were all transformed
into that man's evil slaves!

00:13:44.130 --> 00:13:46.010
Then Domon is...

00:13:56.890 --> 00:13:57.890
Don't trust him, Domon!

00:13:59.690 --> 00:14:02.770
All this horror was
planned by him!

00:14:02.770 --> 00:14:04.900
Even this damage to Shinjuku!

00:14:04.900 --> 00:14:07.280
He's the one controlling
Chibodee and the others...

00:14:07.280 --> 00:14:10.570
Your Master!
Master Asia's responsible!

00:14:11.120 --> 00:14:12.700
What...?!

00:14:12.700 --> 00:14:14.250
What are you talking about, Rain?

00:14:14.580 --> 00:14:15.950
What's wrong with you?

00:14:15.950 --> 00:14:16.830
Domon!

00:14:20.880 --> 00:14:24.380
M-Master? What are you doing?

00:14:30.260 --> 00:14:32.470
Almost. I was so close.

00:14:33.180 --> 00:14:36.930
You almost became one of us,
with so little effort.

00:14:38.480 --> 00:14:39.520
What are you saying?

00:14:39.520 --> 00:14:40.940
You're a total fool!

00:14:41.730 --> 00:14:45.900
You still haven't figured out
my true identity?!

00:15:07.010 --> 00:15:07.670
Why, this is...

00:15:09.220 --> 00:15:10.750
...the one I saw.

00:15:14.180 --> 00:15:15.390
That's right.

00:15:15.390 --> 00:15:18.140
The true identity of the
Undefeated of the East.

00:15:18.140 --> 00:15:21.100
Yes! Master Gundam!

00:15:18.640 --> 00:15:20.980
Master Gundam

00:15:22.770 --> 00:15:24.200
That can't be...

00:15:24.810 --> 00:15:26.520
Master...

00:15:26.520 --> 00:15:28.570
...the noble former
King of Hearts...

00:15:29.400 --> 00:15:31.870
...is a follower of
the Devil Gundam!

00:15:35.530 --> 00:15:38.040
I do not blame you for
being surprised...

00:15:38.040 --> 00:15:41.160
I am also aware you
cannot believe it.

00:15:41.160 --> 00:15:43.040
However, this is reality.

00:15:43.670 --> 00:15:45.670
Are you saddened, Domon?

00:15:45.670 --> 00:15:47.000
Is the truth terrifying?

00:15:48.000 --> 00:15:50.570
As your master,
I can see what's on your mind.

00:15:51.220 --> 00:15:53.260
So believe in me...

00:15:53.260 --> 00:15:54.970
...and you will be saved.

00:15:55.470 --> 00:15:57.470
Now, take my hand.

00:15:58.140 --> 00:15:59.720
And get on your feet.

00:16:00.220 --> 00:16:02.850
I will always be with you.

00:16:02.850 --> 00:16:04.420
So don't worry.

00:16:06.480 --> 00:16:07.320
Come now.

00:16:07.320 --> 00:16:09.730
The Devil Gundam, or rather...

00:16:09.730 --> 00:16:11.800
...your dear brother is waiting.

00:16:11.800 --> 00:16:13.380
My brother is waiting.

00:16:14.360 --> 00:16:15.700
Master is with me.

00:16:16.530 --> 00:16:17.660
That's correct.

00:16:18.160 --> 00:16:19.740
Let's go forth together.

00:16:19.740 --> 00:16:23.620
You shall become stronger
and stronger and stronger...

00:16:24.040 --> 00:16:26.080
...and stronger and stronger.

00:16:27.460 --> 00:16:28.590
You mustn't, Domon!

00:16:30.090 --> 00:16:31.920
He's trying to hypnotize you!

00:16:31.920 --> 00:16:34.300
That's how he tricked
everybody here!

00:16:34.840 --> 00:16:36.180
You must wake up, Domon!

00:16:37.140 --> 00:16:38.300
Annoying insects!

00:16:47.270 --> 00:16:48.400
Just what are you doing?

00:16:48.400 --> 00:16:49.360
Shut up!

00:16:49.900 --> 00:16:52.690
This hand of mine glows
with an awesome power!

00:16:52.690 --> 00:16:55.410
Its burning grip tells me to...

00:16:55.410 --> 00:16:58.200
...defeat the one claiming
to be Master!

00:16:58.200 --> 00:16:59.450
The Ultimate!

00:16:59.660 --> 00:17:04.620
Shining Finger!

00:17:04.620 --> 00:17:09.750
In that case,
Darkness Finger!

00:17:16.220 --> 00:17:17.970
You're weak, Domon!

00:17:21.100 --> 00:17:25.230
Your Shining Finger has
no effect on me!

00:17:38.160 --> 00:17:39.280
How's that?

00:17:39.280 --> 00:17:42.120
You still don't feel like
obeying my command?!

00:17:42.120 --> 00:17:43.760
This can't be...

00:17:44.080 --> 00:17:47.790
My master would never
do this kind of thing!

00:17:47.790 --> 00:17:48.830
Well then...

00:17:48.830 --> 00:17:53.340
...I'll have to convince you
by crushing your right hand!

00:17:57.930 --> 00:17:59.300
Domon!

00:18:08.140 --> 00:18:09.150
This couldn't be...?!

00:18:17.610 --> 00:18:18.860
What's going on?

00:18:28.330 --> 00:18:31.250
The four unidentified objects
that were headed here!

00:18:31.710 --> 00:18:34.250
I can't believe it's them!

00:18:35.960 --> 00:18:37.720
So it's as I thought.

00:18:39.260 --> 00:18:40.470
Precisely.

00:18:44.470 --> 00:18:46.430
Black Joker

00:18:44.600 --> 00:18:46.430
Black Joker!

00:18:51.980 --> 00:18:53.230
Ace of Clubs!

00:18:53.520 --> 00:18:55.400
Ace of Clubs

00:19:02.570 --> 00:19:04.240
Queen of Spades!

00:19:04.280 --> 00:19:06.490
Queen of Spades

00:19:12.380 --> 00:19:13.670
Jack of Diamonds!

00:19:15.000 --> 00:19:16.960
Jack of Diamonds

00:19:16.960 --> 00:19:17.960
We are...

00:19:17.460 --> 00:19:19.470
Shuffle Alliance

00:19:17.960 --> 00:19:19.720
...the Shuffle Alliance!

00:19:22.970 --> 00:19:25.100
A reunion of the
Shuffle Alliance...

00:19:25.100 --> 00:19:27.520
...the Colonies' five
fighting champions.

00:19:27.520 --> 00:19:30.350
We have sought you out,
Master Asia.

00:19:30.350 --> 00:19:34.230
For a top-ranking martial arts master...

00:19:34.230 --> 00:19:35.900
...to be wreaking such destruction.

00:19:36.440 --> 00:19:37.650
Unforgivable!

00:19:37.650 --> 00:19:40.950
How dare you stain
the Shuffle Alliance name!

00:19:40.950 --> 00:19:44.120
Although it's very difficult to
say this to a former ally...

00:19:44.120 --> 00:19:47.980
...you must pay for your crimes
with your life!

00:19:47.980 --> 00:19:51.790
Is that all you have to say to me
after so many years?

00:19:51.790 --> 00:19:53.670
Is that what you say...

00:19:53.670 --> 00:19:55.500
...to your former leader,
the King of Hearts...

00:19:55.500 --> 00:19:58.170
...and the great
Undefeated of the East?!

00:19:58.170 --> 00:19:59.380
Exactly.

00:19:59.590 --> 00:20:02.340
Then, come at me
any way you want!

00:20:06.760 --> 00:20:10.100
Should we take that as
your challenge to fight us?

00:20:10.100 --> 00:20:10.680
Fine, then!

00:20:10.680 --> 00:20:11.810
Please wait!

00:20:12.100 --> 00:20:14.310
Please wait,
members of the Shuffle Alliance!

00:20:14.850 --> 00:20:18.020
Fighting against a former ally
must be avoided!

00:20:18.150 --> 00:20:21.280
Ah, yes, the new King of Hearts.

00:20:21.820 --> 00:20:24.940
I'm sure there's a reason for
the actions he has taken.

00:20:24.940 --> 00:20:25.620
Yes.

00:20:25.620 --> 00:20:27.330
I believe that my brother...

00:20:27.330 --> 00:20:30.950
...or rather, that the Devil Gundam
is controlling him!

00:20:31.500 --> 00:20:34.540
I ask that you please retreat
for the time being!

00:20:34.710 --> 00:20:36.000
Shut up, Domon!

00:20:36.460 --> 00:20:37.920
Don't interrupt.

00:20:37.920 --> 00:20:40.460
I will get rid of these guys
with my own hands!

00:20:40.460 --> 00:20:41.710
Master!

00:20:43.300 --> 00:20:44.680
Please.

00:20:44.680 --> 00:20:46.470
Let's not do this!

00:20:55.480 --> 00:20:56.980
Very well.

00:20:56.980 --> 00:20:59.650
For the moment, I will
honor your request and withdraw.

00:21:00.020 --> 00:21:00.980
Master!

00:21:00.980 --> 00:21:01.860
However, Domon...!

00:21:02.530 --> 00:21:05.110
You are no longer
a disciple of mine!

00:21:06.990 --> 00:21:09.870
Next time we meet,
I intend to destroy you...

00:21:09.870 --> 00:21:13.000
...along with the Shuffle Alliance!

00:21:13.160 --> 00:21:14.580
Prepare yourselves!

00:21:26.590 --> 00:21:27.680
Master!

00:21:29.760 --> 00:21:31.010
Master!

00:21:31.010 --> 00:21:33.490
Get a hold of yourself,
King of Hearts.

00:21:35.350 --> 00:21:37.050
Just leave me alone! I don't care!

00:21:37.050 --> 00:21:40.520
Master Asia is no
longer your master.

00:21:41.150 --> 00:21:44.780
Did he not sever ties with you
only a moment ago?

00:21:50.370 --> 00:21:51.230
Master...

00:21:54.450 --> 00:21:55.330
Master...

00:21:57.120 --> 00:22:00.590
Master!

00:22:06.550 --> 00:22:07.750
Domon...

00:22:28.450 --> 00:22:33.080
<i>Ikusen no tsukihi ga nagaretemo</i>
No matter how much time passes

00:22:33.450 --> 00:22:37.460
<i>tadori tsukenu basho o</i>
There's a place I can never reach

00:22:37.750 --> 00:22:41.920
<i>samayoi motomenagara</i>
As I wander, continuing my search

00:22:42.380 --> 00:22:45.460
<i>aruite yuku</i>
I keep going forward

00:22:45.760 --> 00:22:52.640
<i>koibito yo,</i>
watashi no hitomi no oku de
Deep within my stare, my love

00:22:53.140 --> 00:22:58.350
<i>kasuka ni yureteiru shinjitsu ga</i>
There is a truth that gently floats

00:22:58.560 --> 00:23:03.610
<i>dore hodo tsutawaru no desho</i>
How much of it will you catch?

00:23:03.770 --> 00:23:10.150
<i>Kizutsuita kokoro to karada azukete</i>
Give me your injured body and spirit

00:23:10.530 --> 00:23:14.280
<i>atataka na kono mune de</i>
I will hold you against my warm heart

00:23:14.450 --> 00:23:20.290
<i>umi yori mo fukaku nemutte</i>
So you can sleep deeper than the sea

00:23:31.760 --> 00:23:33.640
Everyone, it's the moment
you've been waiting for!

00:23:33.640 --> 00:23:35.470
Even more surprises.

00:23:35.470 --> 00:23:38.430
Four powerful Fighters
have appeared before Domon.

00:23:38.430 --> 00:23:40.140
The Shuffle Alliance!

00:23:40.140 --> 00:23:42.310
The Shuffle Alliance takes on
Chibodee and the others...

00:23:42.310 --> 00:23:44.650
...and Domon takes
on Master Asia...

00:23:44.650 --> 00:23:46.650
...as they stake their souls...

00:23:46.650 --> 00:23:49.690
...in this upcoming
ferocious battle!

00:23:49.690 --> 00:23:51.860
Next, on Mobile Fighter
G Gundam...

00:23:51.860 --> 00:23:53.360
Warrior's Crest.

00:23:53.360 --> 00:23:55.630
Goodbye Shuffle Alliance.

00:23:54.700 --> 00:24:01.030
Warrior's Crest - Goodbye Shuffle Alliance

00:23:55.630 --> 00:23:58.550
Ready! Go!
